# AuthServices - Bản đồ dự án

Mục tiêu: Học NestJS, xây dựng Identity/Auth Services.

## Sơ đồ luồng (Flow Graph)

```mermaid
graph TD
    Client((Client))

    %% Routing
    Client --> API_Gateway{API Gateway/Routes}

    %% Group 1: Identity
    API_Gateway -->|Register| Identity[Identity & Registration]
    Identity --> CheckDuplicate(Check Email/Username)
    CheckDuplicate --> Hashing(Bcrypt/Argon2 Hash)
    Hashing --> SaveDB(Lưu DB - Unverified)
    SaveDB --> Verify(Email/OTP Verify)
    Verify --> Active(Lưu DB - Active)

    %% Group 2: Authentication
    API_Gateway -->|Login| Auth[Authentication]
    Auth --> LocalLogin(Local: Username+Pass)
    Auth --> OAuth2(OAuth2: Google/GitHub)
    Auth --> Passwordless(Passwordless/MFA)
    
    %% Group 3: Token/Session
    LocalLogin --> TokenMgr[Token & Session Management]
    OAuth2 --> TokenMgr
    Passwordless --> TokenMgr
    TokenMgr --> CreateToken(Cấp Access/Refresh Token)
    TokenMgr --> Refresh(Refresh Token Rotation)
    TokenMgr --> Logout(Redis Blacklist)

    %% Group 4: Account Recovery
    API_Gateway -->|Forgot Pass| Recovery[Account Recovery]
    Recovery --> GenToken(Tạo Reset Token)
    GenToken --> ResetPass(Cập nhật Pass mới)

    %% Group 5: Authorization
    API_Gateway -->|Access Resource| Authorize[Authorization & Route Protection]
    Authorize --> AuthGuard(Verify JWT)
    AuthGuard --> RoleGuard(Check Roles/Permissions)
    RoleGuard --> Resource(Protected Resource)

    %% DB & Cache
    Identity -.-> DB[(PostgreSQL/MySQL)]
    Auth -.-> DB
    TokenMgr -.-> Redis[(Redis)]
    Recovery -.-> Redis
```

